WEBVTT

22:32.592 --> 22:35.511
It looks as though I've been
accepted into your culture.

22:35.595 --> 22:38.514
Your chief, Andy,
inscribed his name on me.

22:38.598 --> 22:39.640
Wow!

22:39.725 --> 22:41.684
With permanent ink too!

22:41.768 --> 22:44.395
Well, I must get back
to repairing my ship.

22:47.983 --> 22:50.109
Don't let it get to you, Woody.

22:50.193 --> 22:52.570
Let what? I don't...
What do you mean? Who?

22:52.654 --> 22:55.740
I know Andy's
excited about Buzz.

22:55.824 --> 22:59.201
But you know he'll always have
a special place for you.

22:59.286 --> 23:03.164
-Yeah, like the attic.
-All right, that's it!
